Subject: mt7996: add reconstructed XR1710G default host TXOP policy

Implement automatic default/UL priority votes with independent firmware
statistics, AP/STA/MLO selection, rollback and lifecycle handling.
This is a validation candidate, not a complete port of vendor scheduling
or a verified throughput fix. See scripts/xr1710g-b27-stock-txop/README.md.

